{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-pluralism-health-seeking","title":"多元医疗体系与就医路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/medical-anthropology/ethnomedicine-systems/medical-pluralism-health-seeking","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多元医疗体系与就医路径\">多元医疗体系与就医路径</h1><p>一个孟买的母亲发现孩子持续低烧：她先翻出家里的退烧药，没好；又带去巷口的草医那里抓了几服，仍不退；接着去社区的私人诊所打了针，半信半疑；最后听邻居说某座庙的祭司能除邪，也去拜了。一周之内，这个孩子被四套不同的医学先后接手。这不是混乱，而是绝大多数人类社会处理疾病的常态——在多套并存的医学之间，按一套有迹可循的逻辑流动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>医疗多元主义指多套医疗体系在同一社会中并存的状态。1980 年，社会学家利斯洛娃提出三分框架，把这些体系归为三个部门：通俗部门（家庭与社区内的自我照护，处理了绝大多数日常不适）、民间部门（非专业化的本土治疗者，如草医、灵媒）、专业部门（受国家认证的体系，既包括生物医学，也包括被制度化的传统医学如中医）。病人并不固守某一部门，而是依据「求医顺序」在三者间穿梭——这一概念由施瓦茨于 1969 年提出，描述人们尝试各种治疗资源的先后次第。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[感到不适] --&gt; B[通俗部门&lt;br/&gt;自我用药/家人建议]&#10;  B --&gt;|未好转| C{病因归因?}&#10;  C --&gt;|自然论小病| D[民间部门&lt;br/&gt;草医/接骨师]&#10;  C --&gt;|疑人格论| E[民间部门&lt;br/&gt;灵媒/祭司]&#10;  C --&gt;|急重/可见病变| F[专业部门&lt;br/&gt;生物医学]&#10;  D --&gt;|无效| F&#10;  E --&gt;|无效| F&#10;  F --&gt;|慢性/无解| G[回流民间或多线并用]\">flowchart TD\n  A[感到不适] --&gt; B[通俗部门&lt;br/&gt;自我用药/家人建议]\n  B --&gt;|未好转| C{病因归因?}\n  C --&gt;|自然论小病| D[民间部门&lt;br/&gt;草医/接骨师]\n  C --&gt;|疑人格论| E[民间部门&lt;br/&gt;灵媒/祭司]\n  C --&gt;|急重/可见病变| F[专业部门&lt;br/&gt;生物医学]\n  D --&gt;|无效| F\n  E --&gt;|无效| F\n  F --&gt;|慢性/无解| G[回流民间或多线并用]</pre><p>下表对照利斯洛娃三部门的特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部门</th>\n<th>治疗者</th>\n<th>知识来源</th>\n<th>处理的疾病</th>\n<th>占比与可及性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通俗</td>\n<td>患者本人、家人</td>\n<td>常识、经验、网络信息</td>\n<td>多数日常不适</td>\n<td>最大、最先、零门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>民间</td>\n<td>草医、灵媒、产婆</td>\n<td>师承、灵性召唤</td>\n<td>怪病、慢性病、关系性病因</td>\n<td>可及性高、成本中低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专业</td>\n<td>执业医师、制度化传统医师</td>\n<td>国家认证的体系</td>\n<td>急重症、可见病变</td>\n<td>受成本与距离制约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"求医顺序-一连串理性的决策\">求医顺序：一连串理性的决策</h2><p>把求医顺序看成「迷信优先、科学殿后」是误读。人类学田野反复显示，病人的每一步选择都嵌着可辨认的理性：他在权衡病因归因（这病像是受寒还是中邪）、可及性（最近的医院有多远、排队多久）、经济成本（这次能花多少钱）、以及信任关系（谁是我熟悉、能商量、不会羞辱我的人）。求医顺序因此是一份会随病情、钱包与人际网络实时更新的决策清单。它的每一步都关乎患者与治疗者两套解释模型能否对上话——当一方坚持「中邪」、另一方只谈「病毒」，求医往往就此中断或转向，这正是上一章解释模型概念的现实演练，详见<a href=\"../foundations-theory/disease-illness-sickness\">疾病的三重维度</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"病因归因如何引导路径\">病因归因如何引导路径</h2><p>为什么同一个家庭，对孩子的腹泻直接送医，对祖母的久病不愈却先去问灵媒？关键在病因归因。当一种病被归为自然论的、机制清楚的（如骨折、感染），人们倾向走向擅长此道的生物医学；当一种病被归为人格论的、关系性的（如连串厄运、久治不愈的怪病、家族冲突后发病），人们则转向能处理「为什么是我」的民间部门。这套分流逻辑直接承接上一章关于自然论与人格论病因的区分，详见<a href=\"ethnomedicine-and-healing\">民族医学与传统疗愈</a>。重要的是，归因本身是流动的——同一场病若久拖不愈，归因可能从自然论滑向人格论，路径随之改道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求医路径的量化视角\">求医路径的量化视角</h2><p>求医研究也吸收了行为科学的工具来刻画选择倾向。一个常见的简化是把选择某条路径的概率建模为各因素的加权组合：设患者选择路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的效用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_j = \\beta_1 x_{1j} + \\beta_2 x_{2j} + \\cdots + \\varepsilon_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 涵盖成本、距离、感知疗效、信任度等，则选中该路径的概率近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_j = \\dfrac{e^{U_j}}{\\sum_k e^{U_k}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.504em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个离散选择的框架并不取代田野的厚描，但它点明：求医不是非此即彼的信仰站队，而是在多个不完美选项间做的边际权衡，任何提高某条路径成本或降低其信任度的因素，都会把人流推向别处。这一视角对设计公共卫生干预尤其重要——若新冠疫苗点远在城外又缺乏社区信任，再有效的疫苗也到不了人身上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多元主义与权力-谁的医学算数\">多元主义与权力：谁的医学算数</h2><p>医疗多元并非诸体系平起平坐的田园景象。生物医学在多数现代国家握有立法、认证与话语的优势，能决定谁算「医生」、哪种疗法可报销、什么宣传算「虚假医疗广告」。世界卫生组织 2025 年《全球传统医学战略 2025—2034》之所以强调把传统、补充与整合医学纳入主流卫生系统并建立监管，正是这场权力协商的最新一幕：纳入意味着承认，但也意味着传统医学必须接受生物医学主导的标准与术语方能「转正」。这种不对称把多元主义直接接入了批判医学人类学的核心关切——医疗资源与正当性的分配从来不是中立的，详见<a href=\"../critical-global-health/critical-medical-anthropology-structural-violence\">批判医学人类学</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>医疗多元主义是常态：利斯洛娃区分通俗、民间、专业三部门，多数日常不适其实在零门槛的通俗部门解决。</li>\n<li>施瓦茨的求医顺序把就医视为一连串实时更新的理性决策，权衡病因归因、可及性、成本与信任。</li>\n<li>病因归因（自然论 vs 人格论）是路径分流的关键，且会随病程流动，承接民族医学的病因学区分。</li>\n<li>离散选择模型提示求医是边际权衡而非信仰站队，对设计可及、可信的公共卫生干预有直接意义。</li>\n<li>多元体系间存在权力不对称，生物医学握有认证与话语优势，使多元主义直通批判医学人类学的资源分配之问。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多元医疗体系与就医路径","id":"多元医疗体系与就医路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"求医顺序：一连串理性的决策","id":"求医顺序-一连串理性的决策"},{"level":2,"text":"病因归因如何引导路径","id":"病因归因如何引导路径"},{"level":2,"text":"求医路径的量化视角","id":"求医路径的量化视角"},{"level":2,"text":"多元主义与权力：谁的医学算数","id":"多元主义与权力-谁的医学算数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"民族医学与传统疗愈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/medical-anthropology/ethnomedicine-systems/ethnomedicine-and-healing"},"next":{"title":"文化精神病学与全球心理健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/medical-anthropology/ethnomedicine-systems/cultural-psychiatry-mental-health"}}